        <mxCell id="21" value="Dynamic Weight Re-normalization Engine (Visible Missingness)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-weight:normal;font-size:10px;'&gt;Tracks 'measured' / 'partial' / 'unavailable' per pillar. Missing pillars set to None (never arbitrary 50.0).&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Raw Composite = (Σ w_i × Pillar_i) / W_avail&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; where W_avail = Σ w_i for measured pillars.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#C5CAE9;strokeColor=#3F51B5;fontColor=#1A237E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="10">
