        <mxCell id="30" value="&lt;b&gt;Stage B: Financial Quality &amp; Value-Trap Guard&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Evaluates Net Debt/EBITDA, FCF margin, Interest Coverage&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;font color='#C62828'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Value Trap Penalty (-15 pts):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Cheap P/E + High Debt / Cash Burn&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;font color='#2E7D32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Compounder Bonus (+3 pts):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Elite Balance Sheet (Quality ≥ 80)&lt;br/&gt;• Value-Trap flags automatically veto directional BUYs → Force HOLD" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#00897B;fontColor=#004D40;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="29">
