        <mxCell id="33" value="&lt;b&gt;Stage C: ATR% Volatility Factor Dampening Multiplier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;ATR% = (ATR14 / Price) × 100&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Calm (ATR% ≤ 1.5%):&lt;/b&gt; Multiplier = &lt;b&gt;1.00&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Normal (ATR% ≤ 2.5%):&lt;/b&gt; Multiplier = &lt;b&gt;0.95&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Elevated (ATR% ≤ 4.0%):&lt;/b&gt; Multiplier = &lt;b&gt;0.90&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Extreme (ATR% &gt; 4.0%):&lt;/b&gt; Multiplier = &lt;b&gt;0.85&lt;/b&gt; (dampens score before violent reversals)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#00897B;fontColor=#004D40;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="29">
          <mxGeometry x="540" y="40" width="480" height="85" as="geometry"/>
