        <mxCell id="48" value="&lt;b&gt;LLM Master Trader (Moonshot Kimi-K3 / Nemotron-3)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Consumes 6 Multi-Agent qualitative syntheses &amp; RAG findings&lt;br/&gt;• Synthesizes macro risks, catalysts, and momentum narrative&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Proposes Advisory Signal:&lt;/b&gt; Candidate [BUY / HOLD / SELL]&lt;br/&gt;• Proposes Entry Price, Stop Loss, Target Price, and Thesis Rationale" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#AB47BC;fontColor=#4A148C;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="37">
